          "text": "An ECS service maintains the desired task count and replaces stopped or failed tasks. Create it with the supplied cluster, task definition, network settings and desiredCount. In the controlled exercise, remove the one approved task, then inspect service events and running/pending task counts until the desired count is restored.",
